msgid "# GLM-5.3 (Experimental)"
msgstr "# GLM-5.3（实验性）"

msgid "## 1 Introduction"
msgstr "## 1 简介"

msgid ""
"[GLM-5.3](https://huggingface.co/zai-org/GLM-5.3) uses the same base model "
"as GLM-5.2 — every gain comes from post-training. Compared with GLM-5.2, it "
"is much better at complex coding and long-horizon tasks."
msgstr ""
"[GLM-5.3](https://huggingface.co/zai-org/GLM-5.3) 使用与 GLM-5.2 "
"相同的基础模型——所有性能提升均来自后训练阶段。与 GLM-5.2 相比，它在复杂编码和长周期任务上表现更佳。"

msgid ""
"This document will show the main verification steps of the model, including "
"supported features, feature configuration, environment preparation, multi-"
"node deployment, accuracy and performance evaluation."
msgstr "本文档将展示该模型的主要验证步骤，包括支持的特性、特性配置、环境准备、多节点部署、精度和性能评估。"

msgid "**Current status and constraints**"
msgstr "**当前状态与限制**"

msgid ""
"- GLM-5.3 has only been tested on the official Docker image `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:v0.23.0-a3` and `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:v0.23.0` **only on multi-node co-located scenario**.\n"
"    - The features listed in [Supported Features](#2-supported-features) are only those enabled by the verified deployment commands in this document, and do **not** imply that all features are supported for GLM-5.3. This is an early-access version; performance optimization and reliability validation are still in progress (see [Declaration](#10-declaration)).\n"
"    - All the scripts below is based on **v0.23.0**, so some params are not supported in main code. If you are using the main branch of vllm-Ascend, please make sure to check it."
msgstr ""
"- GLM-5.3 仅在官方 Docker 镜像 `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:v0.23.0-a3` 和 `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:v0.23.0` 上进行了测试，**且仅限多节点共置场景**。\n"
"    - [支持的特性](#2-supported-features)中列出的特性仅为本文档中已验证部署命令所启用的特性，**并不**意味着 GLM-5.3 支持所有特性。这是一个早期访问版本；性能优化和可靠性验证仍在进行中（参见[声明](#10-declaration)）。\n"
"    - 以下所有脚本基于 **v0.23.0**，因此部分参数在主代码中不受支持。如果您使用的是 vllm-Ascend 的 main 分支，请务必检查确认。"

